552
00:32:44.177 --> 00:32:45.671
and you're so strong.

553
00:32:46.714 --> 00:32:49.764
I guess I'm just
asking if I can join HO.

554
00:32:50.551 --> 00:32:53.719
And I know because of everything.
it's really complicated.

555
00:32:53.721 --> 00:32:54.931
but I'd like to join.

556
00:32:55.932 --> 00:32:57.142
if that's okay with you?

557
00:32:58.726 --> 00:32:59.726
Of course.

558
00:33:01.020 --> 00:33:04.400
Of course you can join. It's
a safe space for everyone.

559
00:33:06.359 --> 00:33:07.359
Thanks.

560
00:33:24.585 --> 00:33:26.794
Well. have you thought
about the service academies?

561
00:33:26.796 --> 00:33:28.921
It's a great four-year education.

562
00:33:28.923 --> 00:33:31.340
Nah. just enlisting.

563
00:33:31.342 --> 00:33:33.252
Look. I think any of the services

564
00:33:33.254 --> 00:33:35.261
would be lucky to have you as an officer

565
00:33:35.263 --> 00:33:37.304
after you graduate college.

566
00:33:37.306 --> 00:33:39.724
but just enlisting after
you finish high school

567
00:33:39.726 --> 00:33:41.684
is a waste of your gifts.

568
00:33:41.686 --> 00:33:42.766
That's a good point.

569
00:33:43.730 --> 00:33:45.229
I don't know. we'll see.

570
00:33:45.231 --> 00:33:47.861
- Think about it.
- Appreciate that.

571
00:33:55.742 --> 00:33:58.451
- Community college?
- Consider it a stepping stone.

572
00:33:58.453 --> 00:34:00.713
After a year. you can
transfer someplace else.

573
00:34:01.664 --> 00:34:04.123
Well. I appreciate the thought. really.

574
00:34:04.125 --> 00:34:07.877
but I don't really think
I'm... college material.

575
00:34:07.879 --> 00:34:09.237
That's too bad. I was told

576
00:34:09.239 --> 00:34:11.379
