to run away from a fight.

577
00:34:25.229 --> 00:34:27.354
Not too bad.

578
00:34:27.356 --> 00:34:30.983
but I'm kind of a Nikon Nazi. and
all you got here are 5Ds. so...

579
00:34:30.985 --> 00:34:33.355
I don't really think
I could partake. Sorry.

580
00:34:34.947 --> 00:34:36.113
Okay.

581
00:34:36.115 --> 00:34:38.240
I'm kidding.

582
00:34:39.577 --> 00:34:42.287
Hey. you were at the homecoming
game. right? November?

583
00:34:43.414 --> 00:34:45.831
God. I was there for Hillcrest yearbook.

584
00:34:45.833 --> 00:34:48.923
Oh. yeah. right. I thought
I recognized you. It's. um...

585
00:34:49.879 --> 00:34:51.629
- Winston. right?
- Yeah.

586
00:34:51.631 --> 00:34:53.172
Pretty wild night. right?

587
00:34:53.174 --> 00:34:55.304
- Yeah.
- I'm sure you got some good stuff.

588
00:34:56.177 --> 00:34:57.468
