- Hey.

589
00:34:57.470 --> 00:35:01.347
Uh... Sorry. Winston. this is
my friend Ani. Ani. Winston.

590
00:35:01.349 --> 00:35:02.929
Yes. we just met. actually.

591
00:35:04.787 --> 00:35:05.810
Hey. Ani.

592
00:35:05.812 --> 00:35:08.562
Winston. you wanted me to
introduce you to the Mathletes?

593
00:35:10.358 --> 00:35:11.774
Right. sure. Yeah.

594
00:35:13.569 --> 00:35:14.569
Catch you around.

595
00:35:16.239 --> 00:35:18.322
Where are all the nerds?

596
00:35:18.324 --> 00:35:20.414
Thought you guys were saving the future.

597
00:35:21.786 --> 00:35:24.578
You know what? I may or may
not have been telling people

598
00:35:24.580 --> 00:35:27.170
