your style and formatting.

714
00:42:05.981 --> 00:42:06.981
Yeah. of course.

715
00:42:07.942 --> 00:42:10.152
These are the last couple
of ones I've worked on.

716
00:42:11.153 --> 00:42:13.113
- Thanks.
- Of course.

717
00:42:17.451 --> 00:42:19.868
Is it true he took on.
like. a dozen guys?

718
00:42:19.870 --> 00:42:21.870
He was just pissed off.

719
00:42:21.872 --> 00:42:23.212
He must have been mental.

720
00:42:24.792 --> 00:42:27.172
Yeah. well. we're all
dealing with our own shit.

721
00:42:28.462 --> 00:42:30.462
- Are you dealing with it? 'Cause...
- Hey.

722
00:42:31.257 --> 00:42:34.177
... you seem. like. not the
slightest bit bothered by anything.

723
00:42:35.386 --> 00:42:38.929
Well. isn't that how we're
supposed to be acting? Normal?

724
00:42:38.931 --> 00:42:41.803
You said we should be the kind of
friends that tell each other stuff.

725
00:42:41.805 --> 00:42:43.475
Well. there's nothing to tell ya.

726
00:42:46.105 --> 00:42:50.315
Look... it's either
bullshit from the football team.

727
00:42:50.317 --> 00:42:52.437
or somebody actually
might know something.

728
00:42:53.571 --> 00:42:54.571
Either way.

729
00:42:55.322 --> 00:42:57.739
we can't do anything about it. right?

730
00:42:57.741 --> 00:42:58.991
So what does it matter?

731
00:43:00.494 --> 00:43:01.584
It matters to me.

732
00:43:17.511 --> 00:43:18.511
Let's go!

733
00:43:19.680 --> 00:43:20.680
Do something.

734
00:43:27.646 --> 00:43:29.813
Tony. Tony!

735
00:43:29.815 --> 00:43:32.691
- Hey. hold on. Can you hold on a minute?
- No.

736
00:43:32.693 --> 00:43:34.453
Hey. let's talk.

737
00:43:35.571 --> 00:43:36.776
There's nothing to talk about.

738
00:43:36.778 --> 00:43:39.156
Last appeal denied. We're fucking done!

739
00:43:39.158 --> 00:43:40.351
"We regret to inform you that

740
00:43:40.353 --> 00:43:43.118
Arturo Padilla's
application for EB5 Visa

741
00:43:43.120 --> 00:43:45.871
has been denied due to
insufficient proof of funds".

742
00:43:45.873 --> 00:43:50.417
- But we can line up more money.
- They said no. Caleb.

743
00:43:50.419 --> 00:43:51.669
after all that hard work.

744
00:43:53.631 --> 00:43:54.671
Come on. Tony.

745
00:43:55.549 --> 00:43:57.924
There must be something we
can do. An appeal or something.

746
00:43:57.926 --> 00:43:59.756
You just don't get it. do ya. huh?

747
00:44:00.971 --> 00:44:04.222
The only way my family is coming
back now is...

748
00:44:04.224 --> 00:44:05.814
... to hire a fucking coyote.

749
00:44:06.602 --> 00:44:08.810
- Can you imagine my mother...
- Tony.

750
00:44:08.812 --> 00:44:11.605
Why the fuck not? Probably
gonna go to jail anyway.

751
00:44:11.607 --> 00:44:12.814
What? Why would you say that?

752
00:44:12.816 --> 00:44:15.093
That pro-am league you fought
in. was there an entrance fee?

753
00:44:15.095 --> 00:44:16.151
No.

754
00:44:16.153 --> 00:44:18.445
- You're not fighting.
- Why not?

755
00:44:18.447 --> 00:44:20.527
- I got nothing to lose.
- Tony. come on.

756
00:44:28.832 --> 00:44:32.250
You expect us to believe you got
that from an accident in gym class?

757
00:44:32.252 --> 00:44:34.461
I have really bad hand-eye
coordination. You know this.

758
00:44:34.463 --> 00:44:37.593
Justin. were you present for
this sports-related injury?

759
00:44:42.054 --> 00:44:43.144
He got in a fight.

760
00:44:44.223 --> 00:44:45.263
Dude!

761
00:44:45.265 --> 00:44:47.182
Who did you get in a fight with?

762
00:44:47.184 --> 00:44:48.240
No one.

763
00:44:48.242 --> 00:44:50.435
A few guys on the football team.

764
00:44:50.437 --> 00:44:51.478
Why?

765
00:44:51.480 --> 00:44:53.355
It was nothing. stupid.
I don't need anything.

766
00:44:53.357 --> 00:44:54.648
Really? Nothing?

767
00:44:56.151 --> 00:44:57.951
Since when do you start the fight?

768
00:45:38.610 --> 00:45:40.740
Clay! Clay!

769
00:45:42.072 --> 00:45:43.072
Scott?

770
00:45:44.074 --> 00:45:45.323
You...

771
00:45:45.325 --> 00:45:46.325
You graduated.

772
00:45:49.371 --> 00:45:51.041
Hey. man. you don't look so good.

773
00:45:54.042 --> 00:45:55.842
Come on. let's get you some water.

774
00:46:27.326 --> 00:46:29.156
You can't save everyone.

775
00:46:30.662 --> 00:46:31.712
You can try.

776
00:46:33.582 --> 00:46:36.166
You have to put your own mask on first.

777
00:46:57.481 --> 00:46:59.272
Dude. you have been...

778
00:46:59.274 --> 00:47:01.114
talking in your sleep all night.

779
00:47:02.945 --> 00:47:03.985
And screaming.

780
00:47:05.989 --> 00:47:07.909
At some point. isn't it. like...

781
00:47:09.284 --> 00:47:10.454
